  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.96,
      "end_seconds": 4.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Good morning, how are you doing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.44,
      "end_seconds": 7.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.92,
      "end_seconds": 11.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "How can I help you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.28,
      "end_seconds": 15.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "I've been losing weight without trying."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.66,
      "end_seconds": 20.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Alright, how long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.02,
      "end_seconds": 31.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "Since this morning, that's when it began. Okay, so and there's a cough as well, two days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.4,
      "end_seconds": 38.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.19,
      "end_seconds": 41.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "My father was diabetic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.81,
      "end_seconds": 46.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.14,
      "end_seconds": 51.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "So, no, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.14,
      "end_seconds": 55.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.39,
      "end_seconds": 69.18,
      "duration_seconds": 11.79,
      "text": "Glimepiride. I take it 2 milligrams, before breakfast for my sugar. I'd been on metformin, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.23,
      "end_seconds": 75.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.7,
      "end_seconds": 90.05,
      "duration_seconds": 12.35,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for nearly five years. I've never really been one for hospitals. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.01,
      "end_seconds": 100.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "Right, so diabetes is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.89,
      "end_seconds": 116.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Anything special about your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.07,
      "end_seconds": 121.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "I try to avoid too much sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.99,
      "end_seconds": 125.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Any sport or activity?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.19,
      "end_seconds": 129.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I play badminton on Sundays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.61,
      "end_seconds": 133.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Any procedures or operations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.12,
      "end_seconds": 142.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Hmm, um, I had my thyroid operated on a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.06,
      "end_seconds": 147.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "And coughing up blood, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.18,
      "end_seconds": 150.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "No. No coughing up blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.47,
      "end_seconds": 158.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "Did you get shortness of breath, blood in the stool or lumps in the neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.08,
      "end_seconds": 167.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Yeah, nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.49,
      "end_seconds": 172.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.37,
      "end_seconds": 176.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.71,
      "end_seconds": 181.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.59,
      "end_seconds": 185.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 203.74,
      "end_seconds": 218.58,
      "duration_seconds": 14.84,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pulse is 97 beats a minute, BMI works out to 29.9, height 152 centimetres, weight 69 kilos, temperature is 39.0 degrees, blood pressure 105 over 68."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.86,
      "end_seconds": 220.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.17,
      "end_seconds": 226.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Alright, come over here and I'll have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.53,
      "end_seconds": 238.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.81,
      "end_seconds": 241.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "I'll go gently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.27,
      "end_seconds": 254.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "I can feel a couple of small glands in your neck, not tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.48,
      "end_seconds": 257.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "I'll go gently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.63,
      "end_seconds": 281.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "Air entry is a bit reduced at the top of the right lung."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.52,
      "end_seconds": 296.84,
      "duration_seconds": 13.32,
      "text": "All done, you can get dressed. Taking everything into account, this looks most like an infection or something chronic going on, I can't say what yet. We shouldn't forget tuberculosis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.34,
      "end_seconds": 301.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Do you think it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.2,
      "end_seconds": 331.61,
      "duration_seconds": 29.41,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an infection or something chronic going on, I can't say what yet is my leading thought, not anything worse. A sputum test is what I'd like next, for chronic cough. Weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down. I'd like you to see the chest clinic as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.33,
      "end_seconds": 345.42,
      "duration_seconds": 12.09,
      "text": "Let's hold off on a chest X-ray for now, and if there's no change next month we can revisit it. Come back after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.18,
      "end_seconds": 350.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Alright, I'll put it in my diary."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.56,
      "end_seconds": 354.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "That's it on my side. Anything unclear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.57,
      "end_seconds": 359.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Hmm, alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    }
  ]
